{"id":"6ff497d2b306db27","title":"呃，来讲西瓜做的小房子吧。","createdAt":1778250737636,"updatedAt":1778250856216,"history":[{"role":"assistant","content":"小朋友好呀🥳，来讲讲【戴铃铛的小刺猬】【西瓜做的小房子】，你说好不好？"},{"role":"user","content":"呃，来讲西瓜做的小房子吧。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"太棒啦！这个房子真有趣！你说它是什么颜色呀？"},{"role":"user","content":"它是红色。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"红彤彤的西瓜房子真好看！它摸起来是什么感觉呢？"},{"role":"user","content":"摸起来硬硬的。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"哇，你说得真好！硬硬的西瓜房子，是什么香味呢？"},{"role":"user","content":"是香喷喷的香味，是水，西瓜的香味。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"哇，香喷喷的真诱人！魔法师现在就把它画出来！"},{"role":"user","content":"好呀，然后西瓜可以帮我增加两个窗口吗？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"太棒啦！你的想法真可爱，魔法师现在就把它画出来！"}],"scenes":[{"text":"有一座西瓜做的小房子"},{"text":"草地上有一座红彤彤的西瓜小房子","imageUrl":"https://p9-aiop-sign.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-vuqhorh59i/20260508223256A770D2AC86A6E9DB2602-9018-0~tplv-vuqhorh59i-image-v1.image?rk3s=7f9e702d&x-expires=1778337180&x-signature=O%2BjjNAJGOcH0g60nbQmCWHqxuX8%3D"},{"text":"草地上有一座红红的硬硬的西瓜小房子","imageUrl":"https://p26-aiop-sign.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-vuqhorh59i/20260508223316DB79FC965FD60ED71931-1908-0~tplv-vuqhorh59i-image-v1.image?rk3s=7f9e702d&x-expires=1778337200&x-signature=p2w4RRf%2F%2FMY5asNc%2FUD4aB1K%2Bak%3D"},{"text":"草地上有一座红彤彤香喷喷的西瓜小房子","imageUrl":"https://p26-aiop-sign.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-vuqhorh59i/202605082233396CB4F54C5C8B18D7ACAD-8054-0~tplv-vuqhorh59i-image-v1.image?rk3s=7f9e702d&x-expires=1778337223&x-signature=MB1Cew3m9owlSEytCLjiuTG%2FPjc%3D"},{"text":"草地上有一座香喷喷的红西瓜小房子，开着两个圆圆的小窗口","imageUrl":"https://p3-aiop-sign.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-vuqhorh59i/2026050822341603C6D83F470AEE0C5DDF-8692-0~tplv-vuqhorh59i-image-v1.image?rk3s=7f9e702d&x-expires=1778337260&x-signature=bfov0h5068p6Mj1ecEC8mU%2BmS24%3D"}],"ageGroup":"3-4","phase":2}